{"model":"gpt-6-luna","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"## System Instructions\n\nYou are an AI assistant that generates step-by-step reasoning for mathematical questions.\n\n## Tool Use\n\nUse the provided tool `extracted_data` to extract correct and accurate structured data from the input.\n\nTool purpose: Function call based on user instructions.\n\nCall the tool with the best supported arguments for the requested extraction."},{"role":"user","content":"Q: What's the sum of 5 and 7?\nA: Let's think step by step."}],"max_completion_tokens":1024,"tools":[{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data","description":"Function call based on user instructions.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"question":{"type":"string"},"reasoning_steps":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","description":"Correctly extract items of type: string"}}},"required":["question","reasoning_steps"],"additionalProperties":false}}}],"tool_choice":{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data"}},"reasoning_effort":"none"}